        "endIndex": 505,
        "text": "### **Candidate [9]: Google Announces In-Orbit Prototype Test for Project Suncatcher**\n* **Confirmed:** Google announced that its \"Project Suncatcher\" research initiative will test machine learning hardware in space by launching a prototype satellite carrying four Google Tensor Processing Units (TPUs) aboard a SpaceX Transporter-18 mission"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 507,
        "endIndex": 686,
        "text": "Developed with Planet Labs, the mission aims to evaluate how TPUs withstand rocket launch forces and space radiation as a precursor to potential solar-powered orbital data centers"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 688,
        "endIndex": 866,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Operational space data centers remain a distant moonshot targeted for the 2030s; this test only evaluates basic chip survivability and telemetry in low Earth orbit"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
