    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1001,
        "endIndex": 1299,
        "text": "### **Candidate [15]: Anthropic Asks Shareholders for 50.1% Founder Voting Control**\n* **Confirmed:** *The Information* reported that Anthropic is seeking shareholder approval for a Palantir-style multi-class share structure granting CEO Dario Amodei and six co-founders 50.1% of total voting power"
